### The metronome (added in v6.11.0)

Ported from FreeShow's `src/frontend/components/drawer/audio/metronome.ts` and
its `Metronome.svelte` / `MetronomeInputs.svelte` / `MetronomeOptions` controls:

- `src/utils/metronome.js` — beat clock, look-ahead scheduler, click sounds
- `src/hooks/useMetronome.js` — React binding for the engine above
- `src/components/MetronomeBar.jsx` — operator control bar
- `src/components/MetronomeVisualizer.jsx` — beat chips and sweep
- `src/context/LyricsStore.js` — `defaultMetronomeSettings`

### Click sound samples

These are FreeShow's own audio assets, redistributed unmodified:

- `public/sounds/metronome/beat-metal-hi.webm`
- `public/sounds/metronome/beat-metal-lo.webm`
- `public/sounds/metronome/beat-wood-hi.webm`
- `public/sounds/metronome/beat-wood-lo.webm`

Local modifications to the ported code — the `clockStarted` sentinel, the run-token
guard on the async start path, once-per-start output selection, the stall
clamp, the stop-time source cancellation and the `AudioParam` gain fix — are
marked in comments at the point of change.

